  "question": {
    "text": "The number of unpaired electrons in\r\n$\\quad\\left[\\mathrm{NiCl}_{4}\\right]^{2-}, \\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CO})_{4}$ and $\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\\right)_{4}\\right]^{2}$\r\nrespectively are",
