  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Configuration for metal (M) in various complex.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2017_che_a52.png\">\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{Ni}^{2 *}$ has 2 unpaired electrons<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2017_che_a52a.png\">\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{Ni}^{0}$ has zero unpaired electrons with\r\n$s p^{3}$ -hybridisation.\r\n$\\mathrm{Cu}^{2}$ \"has one unpaired electron with $d s p^{2}$ -hybridisation.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2017_che_a52b.png\">\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ (b) is the correct answer, i.e.\r\nNumber of unpaired electron (2,0,1)",
    "image": null
  },
